<title>USA: ValuJet, flight attendant talks to resume.</title>
<headline>ValuJet, flight attendant talks to resume.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of Flight Attendants said Sunday the attendants for ValuJet Airlines will resume contract talks on March 24.</p>
<p>The company and the union will hold talks, postponed since the crash of a ValuJet plane in the Florida Everglades last May, in Atlanta under the supervision of a federal mediator.</p>
<p>The union said the attendants are seeking their first collective bargaining agreement with the company.</p>
